# CTRLO-OTHER-PICKERS: Ctrl-O over the /skills menu (the skills scenario's
# workspace), then one key at a time between a Ctrl-O and its return.
# Named skills-* so the skills scenarios' ledger rows (their tabs) apply.
# fx closes the full transcript before every frame while this menu is up
# (reconcileBeforeFrameRender, app_render_runtime.zig:1206-1215@481104fd), so
# Ctrl-O over it shows nothing and every key below is the menu's own, as
# without Ctrl-O: `held` is the composer's plane with the menu, C-j and C-k
# move the mark (routePickerControlByte, app_input_runtime.zig:1093-1116),
# Escape closes the menu (resolveEscape, :2765).
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
gateway skills-turn.json
fx: work skills-ws-fx
xfx: work skills-ws-xfx
wait 3
type /skills
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap open
key C-o
wait 0.8
snap held
key C-o
wait 0.8
key C-o
wait 0.8
key Down
wait 0.4
key C-o
wait 0.8
snap down
key C-o
wait 0.8
key C-k
wait 0.4
key C-o
wait 0.8
snap ck
key C-o
wait 0.8
key C-j
wait 0.4
key C-o
wait 0.8
snap cj
key C-o
wait 0.8
key Tab
wait 0.4
key C-o
wait 0.8
snap tab
key C-o
wait 0.8
key Escape
wait 0.8
snap esc
